# Cataloguing: thirty English-language novels, crime and other modern fiction, one per participant,
# in editions after 2000 whose records name the author only. No two
# share an author or a work, so participants can catalogue in the same repository at the same time.
# Each has a work, an English expression, the manifestation and the author; the publisher is
# recorded as text on the manifestation only, not as an agent.
# Publication data from the MARC 21 records in swib26/marc/Cataloguing.xml.

